[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3172744331","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/109457#issuecomment-3172744331","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109457","id":3172744331,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc69HDyL","user":{"login":"bruvzg","id":7645683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NDU2ODM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7645683?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg","html_url":"https://github.com/bruvzg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-10T16:16:03Z","updated_at":"2025-08-10T16:16:03Z","body":"Order in which fallback fonts are specified is not used in any way. Fallback fonts are selected based on font properties (scripts supported by the font), and since there are no such information in the bitmap font, bitmap fonts will be always last in the list.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3172744331/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3172880906","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/109457#issuecomment-3172880906","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109457","id":3172880906,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc69HlIK","user":{"login":"EtiTheSpirit","id":10490540,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwNDkwNTQw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10490540?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/EtiTheSpirit","html_url":"https://github.com/EtiTheSpirit","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EtiTheSpirit/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EtiTheSpirit/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EtiTheSpirit/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EtiTheSpirit/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EtiTheSpirit/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EtiTheSpirit/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EtiTheSpirit/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EtiTheSpirit/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EtiTheSpirit/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-10T20:44:58Z","updated_at":"2025-08-10T21:03:38Z","body":"An unfortunate thing.\n\nThe current documentation and naming suggests that order does matter, at least to me it does, and I think it would be a good idea to implement this as a feature.\n\nEdit: From what I can tell of the code, it looks like order should matter - all fallbacks are stored in a `TypedArray<RID>` and this is traversed in a very specific order. Are you sure it's not used in any way? Order definitely looks like it should have an effect, at least at face value here (i.e. `Font::draw_char`, [`TextServerAdvanced::_shaped_text_shape`](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/a3b42d85d27668f8992c0779ed3cc82d13db3dd9/modules/text_server_adv/text_server_adv.cpp#L7161). I didn't look very deep so I could be wrong.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3172880906/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3173323811","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/109457#issuecomment-3173323811","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109457","id":3173323811,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc69JRQj","user":{"login":"bruvzg","id":7645683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NDU2ODM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7645683?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg","html_url":"https://github.com/bruvzg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-11T05:34:39Z","updated_at":"2025-08-11T05:34:39Z","body":"> From what I can tell of the code, it looks like order should matter - all fallbacks are stored in a TypedArray<RID> and this is traversed in a very specific order.\n\nFonts are resorted here according to language and script support flags:\n\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/a3b42d85d27668f8992c0779ed3cc82d13db3dd9/modules/text_server_adv/text_server_adv.cpp#L7153-L7172","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godo